    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2b/Reuela_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230804125448\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reuela Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2b/Reuela_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230804125448\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"943\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Reuela Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Reuela_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>救赎之剑士</b>\n</p><p>一位美丽的战士，手持据说犯下无数罪行的被诅咒的大剑。\n她也同样被这把剑诅咒，但与那些被其力量吞噬的前任主人不同，她踏上了解除诅咒的救赎之旅。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820202938\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39662-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820202938 and revision id 63471. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
